: "migrated_image.png", "id": "604215537102483", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974789_2188846638101021_7248977413424545792_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C8ZsLOxCqo8Q7kNvwFlVngJ&_nc_oc=Adra8TFvYWzEIhj55kwi4tTH6lUYn9ZbhVuTUMPSUPcTmLcAeepGyh4USbgZFnFY3fU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSv3L_QUdF_8Ko9cwFV8eXTH4wWr06nm5rDPW_x2M7vng&oe=6B0C7F23"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "1499896166856585", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974450_352706941958280_5977639524413472768_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h6VNREKGA5IQ7kNvwG6sqXi&_nc_oc=AdqyNmIafjltlUIgKuifPgGx-Ya1JDHnx1_nKja7pwuUGkHhZlaEaxHdWJ8M9PXfunI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQ3IX5yutfiT-ksrPT5GWA-x-Byo8WYz-39zyzBimL99w&oe=6B0C5CDD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "529130371347788", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982655_758654184498252_4588748805712642048_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eQkzv4mw0rYQ7kNvwEC7B-T&_nc_oc=Adryg4fXhPVtQhHOSpiEMAFKl6d5V93M1O1-sxyqsAN9Ki1TmKOyjNJ7ITU1zNeMNwk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTav-w2YcNAj40KchG2p7m2IzwaZAbXNG0ZHCH6G9sPkA&oe=6B0C5AD0"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "146428790027337", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974540_1006289679517978_5227941115902033920_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XOsP96l3LxkQ7kNvwHbZSwS&_nc_oc=AdqKvuNXlYU2zsSt5uVnm59wmVUaMB1IZs1siBLEPdIbwC423aCtdsb22mNoWmrk9a8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQF_SZLOnrL8ulTVEGHQGEYKqU_n5L0cRvZSOvNBoZQlg&oe=6B0C72DC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Mini Bowling", "keywords": ["Bowling", "Golf", "Mini", "Sports", "VR"], "long_description": "Welcome to the world of Mini Bowling!  In this VR game bowling meets mini golf to create a totally new experience!\n\nKey Features:\n- 3 Scoring Modes\n- 3 courses with 10 unique lanes each\n- Traditional bowling lane with realistic physics (spin, oil patterns)!\n- 24 bowling balls to choose from (16 unlockable)\n- Customizable sound effects\n- Customizable pin colors\n- Anti-gravity pins\n- Throw force multiplier\n\nStandard Mode:\nIn this game mode, normal bowling rules apply.  Try to get the highest score possible!\n\nStroke Play Mode:\nThis mode will put your skills to the test! The goal is to knock down all of the pins in as few throws as possible.\n\nRush Play Mode:\nSpeed is the key in this mode.  Knock down all of the pins as quickly as possible!  You get unlimited throws in this mode so fire away!\n\nTraditional Mode:\nFeel like changing it up and playing a regular game of bowling? You can! Put spin on the ball to curve it down the lane, and even change the oil pattern on the lane!", "short_description": "Welcome to the world of Mini Bowling!  In this VR game bowling meets mini golf to create a totally new experience!"}]}, "developer_name": "Brian Macumber", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mac13rosstudios.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Brian Macumber", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://mac13rosstudios.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "CASUAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_inter